draft-irtf-cfrg-aegis-aead.txt
    Extracted by a script from appendix A of draft-irtf-cfrg-aegis-aead-18, "The AEGIS Family of Authenticated
    Encryption Algorithms", https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-irtf-cfrg-aegis-aead-18.txt, downloaded on
    2026-10-24.
    License: IETF Trust Legal Provisions; the vectors are data.
    Format: Key = Value records with the group (AESRound, AEGIS-128L, AEGIS-256, AEGIS-128X2, AEGIS-128X4,
    AEGIS-256X2, AEGIS-256X4, AEGISMAC-*) and the name of the vector, and the fields of the draft in hexadecimal:
    in, rk, out; S0 to S7 and M0, M1 (or M) before an update and AfterS0 to AfterS7 after it; key, nonce,
    ctx0 to ctx3 and AfterVj_i (V[j,i] after the initialization); key, nonce, ad, msg, ct, tag128, tag256;
    data for the MACs. Result is fail for the tests that must fail.
    Used: every record.

